      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "\n## Formation Prometheus & Grafana\n\nCe tableau de bord a été **provisionné** automatiquement au démarrage : il vient du fichier\n`grafana/dashboards/00-bienvenue.json`, chargé grâce à `grafana/provisioning/dashboards/dashboards.yml`.\n\nC'est exactement ce qu'on appelle *dashboards as code* (Jour 2, module 9).\n\n### Liens rapides\n- [Prometheus](http://localhost:9090) · [Alertmanager](http://localhost:9093) · [Inbox des notifications](http://localhost:8080)\n- [shop-api-1 /metrics](http://localhost:5001/metrics) · [Node Exporter /metrics](http://localhost:9100/metrics)\n\nSi vous êtes sur Codespaces, utilisez l'onglet **Ports** de VS Code pour ouvrir ces services.\n"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Cibles collectées",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 14,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 5,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "count(up == 1)",
          "legendFormat": "up",
          "range": false,
          "instant": true,
          "editorMode": "code"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "green"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value"
      }
    },
